  data: {
    LLM: "1. Indicator tile determines joker: the tile of same color and one number higher (e.g. Green 10 face-up â†’ Green 11s are jokers). False jokers represent the joker tile only. 2. Player to dealer's right discards first. 3. Each turn: draw one tile (from centre or previous player's discard) and discard one. 4. No melding until the end; first to complete a valid hand exposes it and wins. 5. Winning hand: 14 tiles in sets (3-4 same number, different colors) and/or runs (3+ consecutive same color; 1 may follow 13). Alternative: seven identical pairs.",
    Player: "1. Indicator tile determines joker: the tile of same color and one number higher (e.g. Green 10 face-up â†’ Green 11s are jokers). False jokers represent the joker tile only. 2. Player to dealer's right discards first. 3. Each turn: draw one tile (from centre or previous player's discard) and discard one. 4. No melding until the end; first to complete a valid hand exposes it and wins. 5. Winning hand: 14 tiles in sets (3-4 same number, different colors) and/or runs (3+ consecutive same color; 1 may follow 13). Alternative: seven identical pairs.",
    objective: 'Be the first to form a winning hand of 14 tilesâ€”all in valid sets and runsâ€”and expose it after your discard.',
    gameplay: "1. Indicator tile determines joker: the tile of same color and one number higher (e.g. Green 10 face-up â†’ Green 11s are jokers). False jokers represent the joker tile only. 2. Player to dealer's right discards first. 3. Each turn: draw one tile (from centre or previous player's discard) and discard one. 4. No melding until the end; first to complete a valid hand exposes it and wins. 5. Winning hand: 14 tiles in sets (3-4 same number, different colors) and/or runs (3+ consecutive same color; 1 may follow 13). Alternative: seven identical pairs.",
    keyRules: [
      'Joker = same color, one number higher than indicator. False jokers = only that joker tile.',
